%% Connection flow: user to terminal
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant KorTTY
    participant ConnMgr as Connection Manager
    participant SSH as SSH/Mosh Client
    participant Server as Remote Server

    User->>KorTTY: Open connection (Quick Connect / Tab)
    KorTTY->>ConnMgr: Load connection settings
    ConnMgr->>KorTTY: Host, auth, protocol
    alt Protocol: SSH
        KorTTY->>SSH: Establish SSH session (TCP)
        SSH->>Server: SSH handshake
    else Protocol: Mosh (mosh4j)
        KorTTY->>SSH: SSH exec mosh-server
        SSH->>Server: Start mosh-server
        Server-->>KorTTY: MOSH CONNECT port key
        KorTTY->>SSH: UDP session (mosh4j)
    end
    Server-->>KorTTY: Terminal stream
    KorTTY->>User: Display terminal (SithTermFX)
